{"id": "EUVD-2026-108297", "enisaUuid": "79d674bd-8cb6-3865-b9b5-6b02b7e159ff", "description": "Incus 7.0.0 before 7.0.2 and 7.1.0 before 7.5.0 contains a signature verification flaw in its built-in S3 server that allows presigned URL holders to inject unsigned x-amz-* headers. Attackers can add an unsigned X-Amz-Copy-Source header to a presigned upload URL to copy other bucket objects onto the granted key, disclosing their contents and ETags.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T19:13:43", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T19:13:43", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/lxc/incus/security/advisories/GHSA-mmj7-8rgf-mx2h", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/incus-7.0.0-before-7.0.2-and-7.1.0-before-7.5.0-unsigned-header-bypass-in-presigned-s3-upload-urls"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-115374", "GHSA-m6pj-594x-rw4f"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "56a23f4d-7996-3c73-bb89-157f70847537", "product": {"name": "incus", "vendor": {"name": "lxc"}}, "product_version": "7.1.0 <7.5.0"}, {"id": "5ced175f-121c-3557-b89f-cc2b39739cf3", "product": {"name": "incus", "vendor": {"name": "lxc"}}, "product_version": "7.0.0 <7.0.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "afaa1b7c-6da8-3835-bd6a-8fc87001876e", "vendor": {"name": "lxc"}}], "isExploited": false}